1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roby_Facchinetti
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Camillo Ferdinando Facchinetti''', known as '''Roby Facchinetti''' (born 1 May 1944) is an Italian musician, singer and keyboardist of the band Pooh. He was born in Bergamo, Lombardy.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the main Pooh songwriter, sharing this role with guitarist Dodi Battaglia starting from 1972 LP Alessandra. Facchinetti was a member of the band until their split up in 2016. He also published several solo albums.
2 CONT
2 CONT He participated at the Sanremo Music Festival 2007 together with his son Francesco Facchinetti, and again at the 2018 edition with Riccardo Fogli.
