2 CONT =Theodora Maria Prinzessin zur Lippe-Weissenfeld1=
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #86658, b. 4 April 1924
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=29 Jul 2004
2 CONT
2 CONT Theodora Maria Prinzessin zur Lippe-Weissenfeld was born on 4 April 1924 at Alt Wartenburg. She is the daughter of Alfred Rudolf Maria Egmont Prinz zur Lippe-Weissenfeld and Anna Reichsgräfin von Goëss.1 She married Franz Weikhard
2 CONC  Rudolf Marie Gobertus Konrad Prinz von Auersperg, son of Adolf Prinz von Auersperg and Gabrielle Gräfin von Clam und Gallas, on 17 August 1946 at Salzburg, Austria.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was given the name of Theodora Maria Helene Leopoldine Georgine Ricarda Pascala at birth. Her married name became von Auersperg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Theodora Maria Prinzessin zur Lippe-Weissenfeld and Franz Weikhard Rudolf Marie Gobertus Konrad Prinz von Auersperg
2 CONT *1.Egmont Alfred Franz von Assisi Adolf Maria Englebert Weikhard Prinz von Auersperg+ b. 7 Jun 1947
2 CONT *2.Andreas Karl Egmont Leopold Franz Callistus Prinz von Auersperg+ b. 14 Oct 1949
