2 CONT Egmont Alfred Franz von Assisi Adolf Maria Englebert Weikhard Prinz von Auersperg M, #86647, b. 7 June 1947
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=28 May 2005
2 CONT      Egmont Alfred Franz von Assisi Adolf Maria Englebert Weikhard Prinz von Auersperg was born on 7 June 1947. He is the son of Franz Weikhard Rudolf Marie Gobertus Konrad Prinz von Auersperg and Theodora Maria Prinzessin zur Lip
2 CONC pe-Weissenfeld. He married Contessa Maria Beatrice Lucchesi-Palli, daughter of Conte Adinolfo Lucchesi-Palli and Sarolta Teleki Gräfin von Szek, on 24 May 1980. Children of Egmont Alfred Franz von Assisi Adolf Maria Englebert Weik
2 CONC hard Prinz von Auersperg and Contessa Maria Beatrice Lucchesi-Palli
2 CONT *1.Teresa Maria Michaela Theodore Charlotte Gobertina Prinzessin von Auersperg b. 25 Mar 1981
2 CONT *2.Valerie Maria Agnes Bernadette Paula Anna Gobertina Prinzessin von Auersperg b. 29 Jan 1983
2 CONT *3.Georg Maria Maximillian Adinolfo Franz Paul Gobertus Prinz von Auersperg b. 25 Jan 1985
2 CONT *4.Bernadette Gobertina Maria Prinzessin von Auersperg b. 11 Jul 1987
