3 CTRY United States
1 OCCU unknown
2 PLAC Vogue, Harpers Bazaar 
2 ADDR
1 OCCU unknown
2 PLAC DeMeyer
2 ADDR
1 OCCU unknown
2 PLAC Vogue, Harper 
