2 CONT
2 CONT Prince Shah Karim Al Hussaini Aga Khan (IV) was a British business magnate, racehorse owner and breeder, as well as being the 49th Imam of Nizari Ismailism, a denomination of Ismailism within Shia Islam. He held this position of I
2 CONC mam, under the title of Aga Khan IV, since July 11, 1957, when, at the age of 20, he succeeded his grandfather, Sir Sultan Muhammad Shah Aga Khan III.
2 CONT
